  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKpxd_ZJvWTv15Inq5ea1lK-iu1wOAaQK1gHK7fPETo1qBi_G6EEfUjVCQi765axTmOgQxLIqoPR-ZUbwnbpz-0nnb3_gxga9xt9tDBlwJBn3V-n6thE2Ewb4m-IXybpagH8SDTu3qw0MZ/s1600/215%E6%9C%9F%E5%88%8A%E7%89%A9%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiKpxd_ZJvWTv15Inq5ea1lK-iu1wOAaQK1gHK7fPETo1qBi_G6EEfUjVCQi765axTmOgQxLIqoPR-ZUbwnbpz-0nnb3_gxga9xt9tDBlwJBn3V-n6thE2Ewb4m-IXybpagH8SDTu3qw0MZ/s1600/215%E6%9C%9F%E5%88%8A%E7%89%A9%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n\n\n<p><span style=\"color: red;\"><b>215期目&nbsp; 錄</b></span></p><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><span style=\"background-color: yellow;\">發行人ê話</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/03/e-e-kapbong-elongai-ekoh-uisua.html\" target=\"_blank\">廖瑞銘/ 期待一份有語文主體性ê媒體 --《台文通訊》kap《台文BONG報》合刊</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">台文青年 &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">蔡承甫/ 天！Kám ē光？—獻hō͘所有tī 二二八受難ê台灣先烈</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">連婉汝/ 失去你ê落雨天</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">郭佩靖/ 無聲ê所在</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">吳姿穎/ 買賣青春</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span style=\"background-color: yellow;\">做伙來唸詩</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">林麗玉/ Guán兜ê寶貝狗</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">心內話&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/03/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">林美麗/ 接受別人ê缺陷</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><span style=\"background-color: yellow;\">心情故事</span>&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">Khu Uí-him/ Sim-tsîng</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">楊玉君/ 記持六根</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">台灣人寫真 &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">陳隆</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">陳錦芳</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">盧榮杰/ 世界台灣同鄉會聯合會(世台會)簡史（一）</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">陳詒芃/ 漏水人生‧通電親情</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/03/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">Phàichû/ 看記錄片做記錄</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">蕭喻嘉/ 舞伴</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">Koeh Iàn-lîm/ 2011台美文化交流筆記</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><span style=\"background-color: yellow;\">花埕照日&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/03/blog-post_21.html\" target=\"_blank\">王昭華/ 露螺</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">衝組tī tsia &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">Freddy/ 過年mài騙鬼</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">台語鋸屑 &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">潘科元/ 台語詞素「彩（tshái）」有「獎品」kap「機運」ê意思</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">講古真心適 &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">王淑珍/ 哪ē無叫- -我？</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">Saⁿ-kap讀小說 &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">黃文宏/ 菩薩榮--ā成佛（五）</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><span style=\"background-color: yellow;\">2011阿却賞&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">王薈雯/ 十三、十五hia（一）</span></div>"
